{
 "duration": 25.241,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Leo hikes down to the 3 Mile Resthouse, planning to refill his bottle.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.701
  },
  {
   "text": "The tap is dry.",
   "start": 4.901,
   "end": 5.911
  },
  {
   "text": "On the Bright Angel Trail, water runs from May through October,",
   "start": 6.211,
   "end": 9.866
  },
  {
   "text": "and it can shut off any time a pipe breaks.",
   "start": 9.966,
   "end": 12.109
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Carry all the water you need from the rim, plus salty snacks,",
   "start": 12.459,
   "end": 16.928
  },
  {
   "text": "and ask at the visitor center about water that morning.",
   "start": 17.078,
   "end": 19.859
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Leo carries his own water and climbs out strong.",
   "start": 20.209,
   "end": 23.051
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your canyon trip.",
   "start": 23.351,
   "end": 25.041
  }
 ],
